{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_st04","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_04","title":"临海长街","storyCode":"SN-ST-4","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st04.txt","sourceHash":"8d7fbaad336ea7f626eb71149243b9316d9a1c8f04a9eed313596ca5b7d9afe7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"narration","text":"——伊比利亚著名建筑师、首席船舶设计师布雷奥甘的笔记副本，用晦涩的阿戈尔文字写成。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是阿戈尔人之间的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你身在伊比利亚的国土上，律法便注视着你，我亦然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你与那三名深海猎人有什么联系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打伤过斯卡蒂，奇怪，她一定是打算避战的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的血是特殊的，比我们所有人都特殊。希望你小心擦拭过你的武器了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"提问的是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"决定是否回答的人是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"卡门阁下允许自由行动的猎人，似乎仅限于在盐风城之战中表明立场的阿戈尔人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，碰得到她，看来不全是偶然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"她并不弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......弱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知轻重的评价。她只是对陆地感到生疏，欠缺变通的手段。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要动，阿戈尔人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请配合长官的调查，深海猎人与审判庭缔结了契约，你的一举一动都在破坏我们建立的合作关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......合作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请三思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判官，伊比利亚有多少你这样的战士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"与你无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够不够三千人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那伊比利亚还不够格。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"别想走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐鱼","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖锐的摩擦声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？从哪里......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官！您没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，那个阿戈尔人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的失责！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"他本可趁机取下我的手臂，却选择了逃走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我们还无暇追击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是城镇的方向！它们躲藏在泥土里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"整片土地都遭到了污染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"看清那些灰色的土地，弥漫着险恶的气息的土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"格兰法洛并非遭受深海教会的渗透，而是已经沦陷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"准备迎战。尽早确认卡门阁下的安危。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这荧光的溟痕，就像是它们的城市......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可思议，它们自溟痕之中诞生，它们借溟痕扩散迁徙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐鱼","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（诡异的窸窣声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并非所有生命都渴求独立存在，难怪这些肮脏的东西能躲藏在这座小镇里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可又是谁将它们带来了陆地上？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"这下好了，本以为这趟海边之旅能给人带来些灵感，这不是全泡汤了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（表示赞同的独奏）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海在抚摸着大地，我能感觉到，这很糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希说阿戈尔人打赢了一次，那些深海猎人就是那场战争的遗孤，可看现在这个架势，根本不算赢了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，提到凯尔希，东西给了没？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"给了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绕了一个大圈。她为什么不直接给那个叫歌蕾蒂娅的阿戈尔人？这样不是更快些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（疑问的独奏）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"她想靠这把钥匙把我们吸引过来。那她确实做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，她本来真的打算让我们去找回些什么，或是帮点什么忙。然后改了主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？她不是一直那么神机妙算吗？有什么东西逼她改变了想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或许呢。她的知识多些是不假，但更多的是谨慎，不然她得死多少次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你在比划什么？Dan？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座礼拜堂，很适合当Live House啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，鲨鱼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"看得见的敌人，我们都消灭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无形的浪花在这里延伸，就像沙滩上的潮汐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是种不祥的征兆，我们，我们不该在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来清理一些垃圾，还不足以让她找回感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我们怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把这里打扫干净，我们借伊比利亚人的手，找到那艘船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"它们身上有某些我们不知道的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，那些东西是恐鱼的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......我从以前就一直在想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么它们还能进化得如此迅速？为什么它们还能如此富有活力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我们明明已经......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们即将去弄清楚的问题。这也是我愿意和凯尔希合作的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动起来，猎人，在太阳落山之前结束，听不见海声的恐鱼只是一些低等生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......歌蕾蒂娅？你来了，那我听你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......鲨鱼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手里的，顺手吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它？我时常忘记这把武器就在我的手里......我像是在和它跳舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是你的过去，你的过去就快追上你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们等你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐鱼","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（颤抖的声音）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错的行军速度，达里奥，让你安排的事情可妥当了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"是，阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"惩戒军替我们备好了前往伊比利亚之眼的船。他们已经撤离海岸，包围了这座小镇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"那些误入歧途的人，插翅难逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些宵小之辈不足为惧，但他们带来的新的威胁，确实让人惊讶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的科技足以清理这些污染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是一时的胜利，达里奥。而且这是“阿戈尔的科技”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果潮汐拍打沙滩的每一分每一秒，每一滴水，每一颗沙粒都是恐鱼及其生态的延伸，我们要如何捍卫家园？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会在那之前想出办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我们一定会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"而那些深海猎人，审判庭也已做好交战的准备。我们会将她们扼杀在这偏远的海岸线上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是合适的坟场。希望她们足够明智，也希望凯尔希能做到她承诺的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位就是你的徒弟......我在审判庭就听说过她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！审判官艾丽妮，向您报到，卡门长官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说达里奥在废墟中找到你的时候，一本厚重的经卷卡住了倾斜的房梁，以一种不可思议的平衡救了你一命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻人，达里奥判断你已经有了奔赴前线的意志，你才会出现在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还不成熟，但你跃跃欲试，有着活力与坚韧的躯体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但格兰法洛的任务不比盐风城的轻松，只会更加深入邪恶的中心，你是否做好了准备？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了守卫伊比利亚的洁净与德行，我才提起了剑与灯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这对我而言，不只是一句口号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"她会做好准备的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我相信你的判断，但命运往往不给人准备的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我与那位凯尔希医生还有些事要处理，带领深海猎人小队重返伊比利亚之眼的任务，就交给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亚之眼......长官，我们具体要怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......建立营地，维护道路，确保维修师能安全抵达大灯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从格兰法洛最近的海岸线出发，约五十海里即可抵达最后一座伊比利亚之眼所在的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"前提是，那座灯塔还在地图上它所在的位置上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五十海里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经我们的舰队能远眺平静的海面。可大静谧后，海洋就像是一锅沸腾的毒物，能融化一切碰触到它的事物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一次艰巨的任务。但夺回最后一座灯塔，同样对我们意义重大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为此，我们需要那些阿戈尔人的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有疑问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"她已经去过了审判庭地下的囚笼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你已经见识过了审判庭探寻的真相，即使我们未能得出答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行动吧，年轻的审判官。时间不会等待，如有必要，我需要你们审判时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐鱼","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（响亮的窸窣声）——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没事，抱歉极境先生，我又拖了后腿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，哈哈，别在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些恐鱼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一致的伤痕，三三两两被砸进坑里，这手笔，是斯卡蒂她们吧......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......镇子，被破坏得好严重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——停下！乔迪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——荧光的，植被？浮游生物？还是珊......珊瑚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面的路都被这种东西覆盖了......等等，有什么东西从屋檐上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！躲开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——它们竟然已经在这里筑巢了？！它们不是单纯地在深海教徒的指挥下进攻而已吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（而且......难道这么多的数量，是刚刚诞生的？！这是什么速度？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔迪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，在、在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快逃！往反方向逃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是后面也有，极境先生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嘁，这些怪物筑巢的速度真是比暗潮钳兽的速度还快啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只能拼死一搏了，喂，乔迪，你随便找点什么东西当武器吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伞、伞可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......今天确实像是要下雨啊。总之你握紧了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐鱼","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（响亮的窸窣声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！做好准备！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（得意的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——烧掉它。连着房屋一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（愉悦的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"看来能够清理溟痕的不止有阿戈尔的技术。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你没事就好，发生了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......这位略显失态的阿戈尔人又是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出色的实力，猎人们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无需感叹，让我们迅速进入下一个话题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些时日，凯尔希替你受了不少苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她对我们的帮助我会铭记在心，而你们所做的一切......我也不会忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但此刻的局面是她一手促成，一座狭窄的海边小镇，一场简单的会面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在她的面子上，我们就先以和平的态度对话吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要找到布雷奥甘的遗产，你想找到斯图提斐拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（斯图提斐拉，“愚人号”？是在大静谧之中全军覆没的舰队旗舰的名字......？可是，都这么多年了啊？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更好奇的是，一介外人是如何确定它没有沉没的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么以一位伊比利亚人的视角来看，您认为斯图提斐拉号是否沉没？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有沉没的可能性，确实很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，它也没有回到港湾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一艘船，六十余年没有沉没，却也不曾回到陆地的港口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们能确认它的方位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去可以，现在不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂娅望向一旁的雕塑。\n她对这些东西没有印象，也许是她来到陆地的时候，这些建筑已经在静谧中消亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“伊比利亚之眼”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些奇迹曾是一个壮美计划的基石，如今，大部分灯塔已经在大静谧中遭到毁灭，只留下最后一座。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不属于你们。它属于阿戈尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......布雷奥甘确实是一位阿戈尔人，他来自海洋，却无私奉献。他为伊比利亚的海洋探索做出了十足的贡献。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在灾难之后，你们任由民众将怒火倾泻到阿戈尔人头上——他的头上，纵容愚行显得你们不值得信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可阿戈尔人难道真与大静谧无关？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"隔阂永远是死穴。如果二位执意要继续这个话题，那伊比利亚与阿戈尔等同于已经灭亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"文明不会灭绝，它只会不知倦怠地更替。下一次，就和人类无关了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生，请注意你与卡门阁下说话的态度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨，我们已经做了许多交流......不过，你总是这么做吗？凯尔希？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从庞大的命运体中剖取那些关键的个体，再说服他们以你的想法行事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我的想法只是拯救你们。伊比利亚可以拒绝，阿戈尔同样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果算上这位年轻有为的少女，这里的六人之中，审判庭与深海猎人各有三人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"广场上有着一位阿戈尔人所建造的伊比利亚奇观，作为谈判桌的点缀，再适合不过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"此刻，溟痕还在蔓延，恐鱼已经在镇上筑巢，它们的存在形式与先前大不相同。这种“不同处”足以让人紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果各位还没有认清海洋威胁的全貌，也许我们的确该各退一步，然后坐视以深海猎人的牺牲换来的宝贵时间白白流逝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......那场胜利，是有意义的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。否则在大静谧之后，伊比利亚连苟延残喘的机会都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"至于卡门阁下，我希望您能暂时放下对于阿戈尔的成见。以您的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我已经很老了，凯尔希，不必浪费时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经老到不再有争胜的心态，或是在言语上维护荣耀的力气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生存就是最伟大的荣耀，我比任何人都清楚现状，收起你的言辞。审判庭愿意与深海猎人合作，帮助她们找到那艘遗失的大船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......黄金的......大船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有异议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你们会忌惮阿戈尔与伊比利亚的接触。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接触？啊......如果您能在水下呼吸，不借助设备就前往我们的城市的话，我不介意带您参观真正的阿戈尔技术展览。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"令人期待，执政官阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个大阵的惩戒军与数艘两用军舰将会抵达格兰法洛，设立营地，清扫港口，以作准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达里奥，艾丽妮，你们与几位深海猎人同行。优先确保通往伊比利亚之眼的海路，等我们抵达再做判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"遵命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，如果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果机不可失，我会优先选择与阿戈尔重建联络。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"深入海洋对任何人来说都是一件危险的事情，但于你们而言，这只是一次返乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你会找到那艘船，你也会找到回到阿戈尔的方法，这交由你自己判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许，我们下次再见，会是很久以后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只要别忘记我们所说的。希望你回到阿戈尔以后，能重新审视一遍阿戈尔遭遇的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么事不宜迟，我们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......凯尔希医生，抱歉，从听到灯塔的那部分开始，乔迪他就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿戈尔人，正好。我有许多事情要问你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......我是这个镇子的镇民，我叫乔迪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格兰法洛不该还有本地的阿戈尔人！卷宗显示，这里本就有阿戈尔人与深海教会勾结的劣迹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你的父母是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我的父母是灯塔维修师。他们为伊比利亚之眼而牺牲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家里摆满了尘封的图纸，我......虽然我没有真的见过那座灯塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去见一见......我故乡的意义，我父母为之奋斗一生的意义......我，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。你应当先接受审判庭的询问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不认为在厮杀中保护一个弱小的工人是什么高效的提议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他是布雷奥甘的后人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？可他和影像记录里的布雷奥甘完全不像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便是真的，我们也应当要求他上缴家族留下的遗产，由审判庭接手研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官达里奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔人，你叫什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......乔迪，乔迪·方塔纳罗萨，这是叔叔告诉我的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你应该知道，主动出现在审判庭的面前会遭遇什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扣押他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......让他与你们同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......呃，什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样才如你所愿，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢阁下。不过我更愿见到的，是阿戈尔与伊比利亚长久的、真正的合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千里之行始于足下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，事不宜迟，让伊比利亚之眼重新看看这片满目疮痍的海洋吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
